<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine mutual fund assets up 249 pct June-June.</title>
<headline>Argentine mutual fund assets up 249 pct June-June.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine mutual funds' assets reached $3.95 billion pesos in June, a 249 percent increase on one year earlier and a 19.7 percent increase on May this year, they said Friday.</p>
<p>The Argentine Chamber of Mutual Funds sent Reuters monthly statistics showing that the funds' growth over the first six months of the year was 111.16 percent.</p>
<p>((-Jorge Otaola, Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0695))</p>
